{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/828112-topic-closed-conservative-ragabash","id":828112,"title":"Topic closed ? - Conservative Ragabash...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-11T03:39:26-08:00","id":828112,"title":"Topic closed ? - Conservative Ragabash...","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> I wanted to answer to the Conservative Ragabash topic, but it was closed, without a reason given. Why?<br /> <br /> Anyways, I wanted to point out, that the fact, that a conservative ragabash works good with a player pack, is even more true in a LARP setting, where pretty much every one is a player character. It makes the job even harder though, since you can't get support by NPCs for the lessen you are trying to teach or point you are trying to make.<br /> <br /> Also, I had the problem that my second and longest played character, a Child of Gaia Philodox, was perceived as conservative, although in my head the character was pretty liberal, but the other characters were all even more liberal than him. Too liberal in my opinion.<br /> That is for some part the reason I like it when players take up the challenge to really portray all the tribal stereotypes (or cultural nuances or what ever you call the traits one would associate with a given tribe). Without that, all garou are a mostly indifferent mass of homids, who often only pay lip service to the attributes they should embody.<br /> <br /> It to some extend is the problem, that it is LARP, and people aren't usually jerks - so acting as jerks or bigot know-it-alls doesn't come easy. In any case, the role of a ragabash as a character who essentially has to show people, what they do wrong much more often than strengthen them in a wavering believe that what they do is right, is often pretty hard and to some extend requires to play against the other players. That can also be exhausting. Trying to do so in a fun way sounds good in theory, but doesn't make things easier.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: In any case, though, I like that part of being ragabash a great deal. Much more substance than just being a scout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T06:38:32-08:00","id":828185,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/828112-topic-closed-conservative-ragabash#post828112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi,<br /> <br /> I wanted to answer to the Conservative Ragabash topic, but it was closed, without a reason given. Why?</div> </div> </div> </div>Several posts about &quot;feminism&quot; were deleted, so I think we have your answer.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/828112-topic-closed-conservative-ragabash#post828112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I had the problem that my second and longest played character, a Child of Gaia Philodox, was perceived as conservative, although in my head the character was pretty liberal, but the other characters were all even more liberal than him. Too liberal in my opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, there's definitely a moving Overton window problem in a long-running game. I have a really weird Pack with a rebellious Get of Fenris Ragabash, a Child of Gaia Theurge who has Seen Some Shit, and a Traditionalist Finna Philodox. It's a great time because we can have some serious throw-down discussions about Doing Things Right, knowing we'll eventually find a compromise that wasn't even hinted at in the books that works for all of us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T09:45:44-08:00","id":828275,"title":"","content":"It had turned into a fight about something that was neither conservatism nor Ragabash, so it was closed before that got out of hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T03:12:15-08:00","id":828700,"title":"","content":"Ah, okay. Would be nice if such moderator/administrator actions would be commented....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T03:23:27-08:00","id":828703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/828112-topic-closed-conservative-ragabash?p=828700#post828700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, okay. Would be nice if such moderator/administrator actions would be commented....</div> </div> </div> </div>I though it was pretty obvious, but that's just me.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T08:43:05-08:00","id":828809,"title":"","content":"take it several posts were delted, as as it looked like innocous commenting to me...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T13:45:48-08:00","id":828941,"title":"","content":"I didn't see anything that controversial. It seems like they could have just said for people to stop the tangential argument and let the Ragabash discussion continue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T04:20:07-08:00","id":830148,"title":"","content":"That's my point.<br /> If one closes the topic to prevent further postings, one should say so.<br /> If one closes a topic so nobody posts until everything offensive is deleted, then one should write that one did delete stuff, and reopen the topic for the original intend to be discussed further.<br /> <br /> I can totally understand that forum operators exercise their right to delete posts or ban users, but it should be a transparent process. Especially if it happens from one day to another. Can't remember if I was absent for a day, when this whole &quot;feminism&quot; posts happened, or if it all was while it was already night time in europe. I just found the topic closed, for no apparent reason. And that is kind of redundant, if the reason is go, the topic doesn't need to stay closed <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}